---
import { site } from '@data/site';

const founderPhoto = '/andrei.jpg';
---

<section class="diff">
  <div class="site-container">
    <div class="diff__top">
      <div class="diff__body">
        <div class="diff__lead" data-reveal>
          <p class="diff__eyebrow"><span class="diff__tick"></span>De ce Simplead</p>
          <h2 class="diff__title">
            Designul bun nu se ghicește. <span>Se vede și se măsoară.</span>
          </h2>
          <p class="diff__sub">
            Un material bun nu e cel care arată frumos, ci cel care chiar funcționează. De-asta, în
            fiecare proiect, fie că vorbim de identitate vizuală sau de un site, pornim de la cum
            gândesc și aleg oamenii. Vrem rezultate reale, nu lucruri făcute de dragul de a bifa.
            AI-ul ne ajută să lucrăm mai repede, dar cum arată totul la final decidem noi.
          </p>
          <dl class="diff__meta">
            <div>
              <dt>Metodă</dt>
              <dd>Eye-tracking + heatmap</dd>
            </div>
            <div>
              <dt>Ce citim</dt>
              <dd>Primele secunde de atenție</dd>
            </div>
          </dl>
        </div>

        <figure class="study" data-reveal>
          <span class="study__mark study__mark--tl" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <span class="study__mark study__mark--tr" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <span class="study__mark study__mark--bl" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <span class="study__mark study__mark--br" aria-hidden="true"></span>

          <figcaption class="study__cap">
            <span class="study__id">Studiu de caz</span>
            <span class="study__client">FEAA Galați · reclamă</span>
          </figcaption>

          <div class="study__plate">
            <div class="plate">
              <span class="plate__tag">Fig. 01 · Design</span>
              <img
                src="/exemplu-design.png"
                alt="Reclama FEAA Galați așa cum a fost publicată."
                loading="lazy"
              />
            </div>
            <div class="study__arrow" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg
                viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                fill="none"
                stroke="currentColor"
                stroke-width="2"
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"></path></svg
              >
            </div>
            <div class="plate plate--heat">
              <span class="plate__tag">Fig. 02 · Heatmap</span>
              <img
                src="/exemplu-heatmap.png"
                alt="Aceeași reclamă cu heatmap din eye-tracking, care arată unde se concentrează privirea."
                loading="lazy"
              />
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="study__legend" aria-hidden="true">
            <span>Atenție</span>
            <i class="study__scale"></i>
            <span>scăzută → ridicată</span>
          </div>

          <div class="study__notes">
            <p>
              <b>Reclama, așa cum o vede oricine.</b> Un design publicat pentru FEAA Galați. Frumos,
              dar atât poate vedea ochiul liber.
            </p>
            <p>
              <b>Heatmap din eye-tracking.</b> Zonele calde arată unde cade privirea întâi: pe fețe,
              pe „economic", pe buton. De-aici știm unde să punem mesajul, fără să ghicim.
            </p>
          </div>
        </figure>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- „Omul din spate" - bandă full-width la baza secțiunii -->
  <figure class="diff__founder" data-reveal>
    <div class="site-container diff__founder-inner">
      <span class="diff__avatar">
        {
          founderPhoto ? (
            <img src={founderPhoto} alt={site.founder} loading="lazy" />
          ) : (
            <span>AP</span>
          )
        }
      </span>
      <blockquote class="diff__founder-quote">
        „Nu folosesc partea asta ca să sune bine, ci ca să iau decizii mai bune pentru proiectul
        tău.”
      </blockquote>
      <figcaption class="diff__founder-by">
        <b>{site.founder}</b>
        <span>Doctor în marketing, cu cercetare în neuromarketing</span>
      </figcaption>
    </div>
  </figure>
</section>

<style>
  .diff {
    position: relative;
    background: var(--ink);
    color: #fff;
    padding-block: clamp(72px, 10vw, 128px) 0;
    overflow: visible;
  }
  .diff::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background-image:
      linear-gradient(rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.045) 1px, transparent 1px),
      linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.045) 1px, transparent 1px);
    background-size: 72px 72px;
    -webkit-mask-image: radial-gradient(110% 90% at 15% 0%, #000, transparent 70%);
    mask-image: radial-gradient(110% 90% at 15% 0%, #000, transparent 70%);
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .diff__top {
    position: relative;
    --font-mono: ui-monospace, 'SF Mono', 'JetBrains Mono', 'Roboto Mono', Menlo, monospace;
  }

  /* Header */
  .diff__eyebrow {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.3em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--cyan);
  }
  .diff__tick {
    width: 30px;
    height: 1px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--cyan), transparent);
  }
  .diff__title {
    margin-top: 16px;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: clamp(1.7rem, 2.7vw, 2.5rem);
    line-height: 1.1;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }
  .diff__title span {
    color: var(--cyan);
  }

  /* Body grid: lead (text) stânga, figura dreapta */
  .diff__body {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 0.9fr 1.1fr;
    gap: clamp(36px, 5vw, 72px);
    align-items: center;
  }

  /* Left lead */
  .diff__sub {
    margin: 22px 0 0;
    max-width: 46ch;
    font-size: 1.075rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: #d7deef;
  }
  .diff__meta {
    margin: 26px 0 0;
    display: grid;
    gap: 1px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    border-radius: var(--r-sm);
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .diff__meta > div {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 16px;
    padding: 13px 16px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
  }
  .diff__meta dt {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.66rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--muted-dark);
  }
  .diff__meta dd {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: #fff;
  }

  /* Right: research figure */
  .study {
    position: relative;
    margin: 0;
    padding: clamp(16px, 1.8vw, 24px);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
    border-radius: var(--r-lg);
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.045), rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.012));
    box-shadow: var(--sh-lg);
  }
  .study__mark {
    position: absolute;
    width: 15px;
    height: 15px;
    border: 0 solid rgba(0, 224, 198, 0.65);
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .study__mark--tl {
    top: 7px;
    left: 7px;
    border-top-width: 1px;
    border-left-width: 1px;
    border-top-left-radius: 9px;
  }
  .study__mark--tr {
    top: 7px;
    right: 7px;
    border-top-width: 1px;
    border-right-width: 1px;
    border-top-right-radius: 9px;
  }
  .study__mark--bl {
    bottom: 7px;
    left: 7px;
    border-bottom-width: 1px;
    border-left-width: 1px;
    border-bottom-left-radius: 9px;
  }
  .study__mark--br {
    bottom: 7px;
    right: 7px;
    border-bottom-width: 1px;
    border-right-width: 1px;
    border-bottom-right-radius: 9px;
  }

  .study__cap {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    padding-bottom: 14px;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    border-bottom: 1px dashed rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.16);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .study__id {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 9px;
    color: var(--cyan);
  }
  .study__id::before {
    content: '';
    width: 7px;
    height: 7px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--cyan);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px rgba(0, 224, 198, 0.16);
  }
  .study__client {
    color: var(--muted-dark);
  }

  .study__plate {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr auto 1fr;
    align-items: center;
    gap: clamp(10px, 1.4vw, 18px);
  }
  .plate {
    position: relative;
    border-radius: var(--r-sm);
    overflow: hidden;
    background: #02061f;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
    transition:
      transform 0.3s ease,
      border-color 0.3s ease;
  }
  .plate:hover {
    transform: translateY(-3px);
    border-color: rgba(0, 224, 198, 0.4);
  }
  .plate img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
  }
  .plate__tag {
    position: absolute;
    left: 8px;
    top: 8px;
    z-index: 2;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 7px;
    padding: 4px 9px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.6rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #fff;
    background: rgba(2, 8, 40, 0.74);
    backdrop-filter: blur(6px);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.16);
    border-radius: 6px;
  }
  .plate--heat .plate__tag {
    color: var(--signal);
  }
  .plate--heat .plate__tag::before {
    content: '';
    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--signal);
    animation: studyPulse 2.2s ease-out infinite;
  }
  @keyframes studyPulse {
    0% {
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(245, 217, 63, 0.55);
    }
    70% {
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 7px rgba(245, 217, 63, 0);
    }
    100% {
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(245, 217, 63, 0);
    }
  }
  .study__arrow {
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    width: 28px;
    height: 28px;
    color: var(--cyan);
  }
  .study__arrow svg {
    width: 20px;
    height: 20px;
  }

  .study__legend {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    margin-top: 16px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.64rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--muted-dark);
  }
  .study__scale {
    flex: 1;
    height: 6px;
    border-radius: 3px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--electric), var(--cyan), var(--signal), #ff4d3d);
  }

  .study__notes {
    counter-reset: note;
    margin-top: 20px;
    display: grid;
    gap: 12px;
  }
  .study__notes p {
    position: relative;
    margin: 0;
    padding-left: 28px;
    font-size: 0.86rem;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--muted-dark);
  }
  .study__notes p b {
    color: #fff;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .study__notes p::before {
    counter-increment: note;
    content: '0' counter(note);
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 1px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    color: var(--cyan);
  }

  @media (max-width: 560px) {
    .study__plate {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 14px;
    }
    .study__arrow {
      transform: rotate(90deg);
      justify-self: center;
    }
  }

  /* „Omul din spate" - bandă full-width peste tranziția dark → light */
  .diff__founder {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
    overflow: hidden;
    margin-top: clamp(64px, 9vw, 110px);
    margin-bottom: clamp(-76px, -6vw, -50px);
    padding: 32px 0;
    background:
      radial-gradient(90% 180% at 86% 130%, rgba(110, 91, 224, 0.4), transparent 55%),
      radial-gradient(70% 150% at 8% -30%, rgba(0, 119, 252, 0.2), transparent 55%), #020a3a;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
    box-shadow: 0 34px 70px -34px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.55);
  }
  .diff__founder-inner {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 28px;
  }
  .diff__avatar {
    flex: none;
    width: 76px;
    height: 76px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    overflow: hidden;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--electric), var(--cyan));
    color: #fff;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    box-shadow: var(--glow-electric);
  }
  .diff__avatar img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: center 22%;
  }
  .diff__founder-quote {
    flex: 1;
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: clamp(1.02rem, 1.5vw, 1.28rem);
    line-height: 1.4;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    color: #fff;
    text-wrap: pretty;
  }
  .diff__founder-by {
    flex: none;
    margin-left: clamp(28px, 5vw, 80px);
    text-align: right;
  }
  .diff__founder-by b {
    display: block;
    color: #fff;
    font-size: 0.98rem;
  }
  .diff__founder-by span {
    display: block;
    margin-top: 2px;
    font-size: 0.84rem;
    color: var(--cyan);
  }
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .diff__founder-inner {
      flex-direction: column;
      text-align: center;
      gap: 16px;
    }
    .diff__founder-quote,
    .diff__founder-by {
      text-align: center;
    }
    .diff__founder-by {
      margin-left: 0;
    }
  }
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .diff__body {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 40px;
    }
  }
</style>
